I've added the QueryNormalizerProvider and wrapped it around the component. The QueryNormalizerProvider requires a queryClient instance, which we get from the useQueryClient hook since the component is already wrapped in a QueryClientProvider (as we can see from the Wrapper.tsx file).

This should resolve the "No QueryNormalizer set" errors since we're now providing the required context. The component will have access to both the scope context and query normalizer context.

